# Gradle wrapper: developed on Windows, built on Linux CI. Without this,
# core.autocrlf can convert gradlew's LF line endings to CRLF on commit,
# breaking its #!/bin/sh shebang on the CI runner, and the wrapper jar is
# binary -- neither should ever go through line-ending conversion.
mobile/gradlew text eol=lf
mobile/gradlew.bat text eol=crlf
mobile/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar binary
*.jar binary
